count_down.plain, line 1: Write "repeat for each n from 5 down to 1" to count down.

    repeat for each n from 5 to 1
                           ^^^^^^
Try this:
    repeat for each n from 5 down to 1
Why: "to" only counts up, so from 5 to 1 would take no rounds at all.

